# TODO: Replace "Shop" (placeholder name) with actual

~ greet
Shop: Well, if it isn't my favorite little gambling addict.
Shop: What are you here for?
=>< options

~ options
- Buy
	if firstBuy:
		Shop: Really now? You're already struggling to pay off your debt, and you'd rather gamble more?
		Shop: .. I like your ambition. Come, let's make this quick.
		Shop: Don't want those pesky security guards catching us.
		set firstBuy = false
	else:
		Shop: That's what I like to hear!
	=>< shop
- Repay Loan 
	=>< payLoan
- New Loan
	Shop: Out of cash already?
	Shop: I think I'm done giving you chances.
	do game_over()

- Nevermind
Shop: Don't let the door hit you on your way out.
=> END!

~ payLoanDeath
Mr. Shady: Alright, time's up. Let's see if you got the money for your quota.
if hasEnough(current_quota):
	do payLoan()
	if quotas_paid == 1:
		Mr. Shady: Well, color me surprised. You managed to pay off part of your interest.
		Mr. Shady: But you're not free to go just yet, oh no. You'll be sticking around for quite a while.
		Mr. Shady: Here's your new quota. Now get to it. Chop-chop.
	else:
		Mr. Shady: Good on ya, paying your quotas. Here's your next. Chop-chop.
else:
	Mr. Shady: Oh, no. This amount simply won't do.
	set is_game_over = false
	do game_over()
	=> END!

~ payLoan
if hasEnough(current_quota):
	do payLoan()
	if quotas_paid == 1:
		Shop: Well, color me surprised. You managed to pay off part of your interest.
		Shop: But you're not free to go just yet, oh no. You'll be sticking around for quite a while.
		Shop: Here's your new quota. Now get to it. Chop-chop.
	else:
		Shop: Good on ya, paying your quotas. Here's your next. Chop-chop.
	=> END!
else:
	Shop: Buddy, where did you learn to count? This is nowhere near enough.
	Shop: Get back out there and earn me some more money. I don't care how you do it.
=> END

~ shop
Shop: Take your pick.
- Cards
	# getCost take cardCost * anteMult
	# TODO (Matthew): buying gives a random card (GameManager.random_card), it shows up in the
	# inventory HUD and can be swapped into your hand at the blackjack table
	if firstCards:
		Shop: Oh, these? I give you a random card from this deck here.
		Shop: If you're good, you can swap out one of your cards at the blackjack table.
		Shop: It's {{getCost(Item.card)}}. If you don't like it, don't buy.
		set firstCards = false
	else: 
		Shop: {{getCost(Item.card)}}. Don't like it, don't buy it.
	- Buy
		if not hasEnough(getCost(Item.card)):
			Shop: What do you take me for, a charity?
			Shop: Get outta here. => END!
		elif not hasInventorySpace():
			Shop: Maybe try again after you got a bit more space in your inventory.
			Shop: Anything else you want from me?
			=>< options
		else:
			do buyItem(Item.card)
			Shop: Pleasure doing business.
			Shop: Anything else?
		=> shop
	- Go Back
		Shop: Having second thoughts? Bit too late for that.
		=>< shop
- EMF
	# TODO (Matthew): polish these lines
	Shop: An EMF jammer. Point it at a camera and it goes dark for thirty seconds.
	Shop: {{getCost(Item.emf)}}. One use.
	- Buy
		if not hasEnough(getCost(Item.emf)):
			Shop: What do you take me for, a charity?
			Shop: Get outta here. => END!
		elif not hasInventorySpace():
			Shop: Maybe try again after you got a bit more space in your inventory.
			=>< options
		else:
			do buyItem(Item.emf)
			Shop: Pleasure doing business.
		=> shop
	- Go Back
		=> shop
- Nevermind
	Shop: Welp, I won't push you on it. Remember to pay your debts on time.
	=> END!

~ broke
Shop: Oh, looks like someone went broke. This won't do...

